# v6 lanes V6-W (composition ew-theme-v6) and V6-U (universe linked-operating-v1): the env knobs and the exact
# root command lines for v6_train.sh (lane V6-C1 owns that script; merge from here, do not source blindly).
# v4-prereg.md "## v6 revision" items V6-W and V6-U. TRAIN 2020-2022 only; nothing >= 2023 is read.
# Run from C:/atx-wt/pool-2 with the v51_train.sh helpers (PY, BR, IC, bad/run/rc/pin/state/record). Every path
# below passes v51_train.sh's bad() (no validation / VAL / 2023-2025 token).
#
# REQUIRES a rebuilt build-equity/bin/atx-equity-strategy-ic.exe containing the V6-W runner/composition change
# (theme_redistribution, within-theme-v1). ew-theme-v6 weights files carry schema atx.dsl-composition-weights/v2,
# which an older binary refuses ("composition weights schema/library identity"); the w-phase check below also
# confirms from the outputs that the redistribution was applied.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- knobs
COMPOSITION=ew-theme-v6                    # fit: --composition (ew-theme-v1 | ew-theme-aim-v1 | ew-theme-v6)
UNIVERSE=research-prior63-usd-adv-topn-v1  # u: default = role v2 as is; linked-operating-v1 = V6-U restricted role
W_MAX_MEMORY_MIB=2304                      # w with ew-theme-v6: the runner's --max-memory-mib admit ESTIMATE only
                                           # (admission ~1449 MB (v51 w pass) + 7 themes x 16 B x 1155 x 5627 cells
                                           # (728 MB) = ~2076 MiB > the 1536 used so far). BR's --max-rss-mib cap
                                           # stays 1536 MiB, unchanged (v51 peak 505 MiB + ~694 MiB theme planes).

